                        <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill="currentcolor" d="M15.898,4.045c-0.271-0.272-0.713-0.272-0.986,0l-4.71,4.711L5.493,4.045c-0.272-0.272-0.714-0.272-0.986,0s-0.272,0.714,0,0.986l4.709,4.711l-4.71,4.711c-0.272,0.271-0.272,0.713,0,0.986c0.136,0.136,0.314,0.203,0.492,0.203c0.179,0,0.357-0.067,0.493-0.203l4.711-4.711l4.71,4.711c0.137,0.136,0.314,0.203,0.494,0.203c0.178,0,0.355-0.067,0.492-0.203c0.273-0.273,0.273-0.715,0-0.986l-4.711-4.711l4.711-4.711C16.172,4.759,16.172,4.317,15.898,4.045z"></path></svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="portals-dialog-header" >
                        <div id="portals-dialog-title" class="dialog-icon icon-asic-portals">ASIC portals</div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="asic-accordion">
                        <div class="asic-smallbanner-title">
                            <p class="asic-text-title asic-portal-mobile-smallbanner" >I am a</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="asic-details-column">
                            <details id="portals-business" class="asic-accordion__item" name="accordion-portal-group">
                                <summary class="asic-accordion__title asic-portal-accordian-banner"><span class="asic-portal-hidden">I am a</span> Business name holder</summary>

                                <div class="asic-tabs__panel asic-content">
                                    <div class="asic-field">
                                        <label for="select-my-task-bn" class="asic-field__label">I want to</label>
                                        <select id="select-my-task-bn" class="asic-select asic-select--fill select-portal" aria-required="true">
                                            <option data-open="content-bn-register" selected="" value="bn-register">Register a business name</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-bn-renew" value="bn-renew">Renew my business name</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-bn-update" value="bn-update">Update my details</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-bn-transfer" value="bn-transfer">Cancel or transfer my business name</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-bn-learn" value="bn-learn">Learn about ASIC's online services</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-bn" id="content-bn-register">
                                        <p>Information and steps on how to register a business name</p>
                                        <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="/for-business-and-companies/business-names/register-a-business-name/">Register a business name</a>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-bn" id="content-bn-renew" hidden="">
                                        <p>To renew a business name, you will need your account number or ABN handy.</p>
                                        <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="/for-business-and-companies/business-names/renew-a-business-name-registration/">Renewing your business name</a>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-bn" id="content-bn-update" hidden="">
                                        <p>The ASIC Connect portal will allow you to:</p>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>manage an existing business name</li>
                                            <li>update your business name details</li>
                                        </ul>
                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://asicconnect.asic.gov.au/public/faces/landingPage"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://asicconnect.asic.gov.au/public/faces/GetStarted">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-bn" id="content-bn-transfer" hidden="">
                                        <p>The ASIC Connect portal will allow you to:</p>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>manage an existing business name</li>
                                            <li>update your business name details</li>
                                        </ul>
                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://asicconnect.asic.gov.au/public/faces/landingPage"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://asicconnect.asic.gov.au/public/faces/GetStarted">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-bn" id="content-bn-learn" hidden="">
                                        <p>Within online services for business name holders, you can: </p>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>log in or sign up to ASIC's portals</li>
                                            <li>learn about ASIC's online services and processes</li>
                                            <li>access user guides</li>
                                            <li>read FAQs.</li>
                                        </ul>
                                        <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="/online-services/asic-portals/business-name-holders">Business name holders</a>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </details>


                            <details id="portals-company" class="asic-accordion__item" name="accordion-portal-group">
                                <summary class="asic-accordion__title asic-portal-accordian-banner"><span class="asic-portal-hidden">I am a</span> Company officeholder</summary>
                                <div class="asic-tabs__panel asic-content" >
                                    <div class="asic-field">
                                        <label for="select-my-task-co" class="asic-field__label">I want to</label>
                                        <select id="select-my-task-co" class="asic-select asic-select--fill select-portal" aria-required="true">
                                            <option data-open="content-co-register" selected="" value="co-register">Register a new company</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-co-update" value="co-update">Manage my company details</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-co-close" value="co-close">Download my annual review statement</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-co-lodge" value="co-lodge">Lodge regulatory documents</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-co-learn" value="co-learn">Learn about ASIC's online services</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-co" id="content-co-register">
                                        <p>Information and steps on how to register a new business</p>
                                        <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="/for-business-and-companies/companies/register-a-company/">Register a company</a>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-co" id="content-co-update" hidden="">
                                        <p>Manage your company details via the company officeholder portal: </p>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>Update your company details</li>
                                            <li>Voluntarily deregister your company in the Company officeholder portal.</li>
                                        </ul>
                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://www.edge.asic.gov.au/004/compportal/get/ServicesLogin"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://www.edge.asic.gov.au/cgi-bin/Lodgement/RC99V004/start/ApplicationLogin">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-co" id="content-co-close" hidden="">
                                        <p>Download your company annual review statement from ASIC, which includes your annual invoice and payment details.</p>
                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://www.edge.asic.gov.au/004/compportal/get/ServicesLogin"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://www.edge.asic.gov.au/cgi-bin/Lodgement/RC99V004/start/ApplicationLogin">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-co" id="content-co-lodge" hidden="">
                                        <p>Lodge regulatory statements, documents and transactions in the Regulatory portal.</p>
                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://regulatoryportal.asic.gov.au/Account/SignIn"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://regulatoryportal.asic.gov.au/registration/">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-co" id="content-co-learn" hidden="">
                                        <p>Within online services for company officeholders, you can: </p>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>log in or sign up to ASIC's portals</li>
                                            <li>learn about ASIC's online services and processes</li>
                                            <li>access user guides.</li>
                                        </ul>
                                        <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="/online-services/asic-portals/company-officeholders/">Company officeholders</a>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </details>


                            <details id="portals-registered" class="asic-accordion__item" name="accordion-portal-group">
                                <summary class="asic-accordion__title asic-portal-accordian-banner"><span class="asic-portal-hidden">I am a</span>  Registered agent and authorised lodger</summary>
                                <div class="asic-tabs__panel asic-content">
                                    <div class="asic-field">
                                        <label for="select-my-task-ra" class="asic-field__label">I want to</label>
                                        <select id="select-my-task-ra" class="asic-select asic-select--fill select-portal" aria-required="true">
                                            <option data-open="content-ra-updateclient" selected="" value="ra-updateclient">Update my clients details</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-ra-updateagent" value="ra-updateagent">Update my agent details</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-ra-learn" value="ra-learn">Learn about ASIC's online services</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-ra" id="content-ra-updateclient">
                                        <p>Update your client details via the Registered agent portal.</p>
                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://www.edge.asic.gov.au/001/regaportal/get/ServicesLogin"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://www.edge.asic.gov.au/cgi-bin/Lodgement/RC99V004/start/ApplicationLogin">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-ra" id="content-ra-updateagent" hidden="">
                                        <p>Information about how you can update and/or cancel your registered agent registration.</p>
                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://www.edge.asic.gov.au/001/regaportal/get/ServicesLogin"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://www.edge.asic.gov.au/cgi-bin/Lodgement/RC99V004/start/ApplicationLogin">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-ra" id="content-ra-learn" hidden="">
                                        <p>Within online services for registered agents and authorised lodgers, you can: </p>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>log in or sign up to ASIC's portals</li>
                                            <li>learn about ASIC's online services and processes</li>
                                            <li>access user guides</li>
                                            <li>read FAQs.</li>
                                        </ul>
                                        <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="/online-services/asic-portals/registered-agents/">Registered agents</a>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </details>


                            <details id="portals-afs" class="asic-accordion__item" name="accordion-portal-group">
                                <summary class="asic-accordion__title asic-portal-accordian-banner"><span class="asic-portal-hidden">I am an</span> AFS Licensee and AFS representative</summary>
                                <div class="asic-tabs__panel asic-content">
                                    <div class="asic-field">
                                        <label for="select-my-task-afs" class="asic-field__label">I want to</label>
                                        <select id="select-my-task-afs" class="asic-select asic-select--fill select-portal" aria-required="true">
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-apply" selected="" value="afs-apply">Apply for and vary an AFS licence</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-update" value="afs-update">Update licence details and submit documents</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-appoint" value="afs-appoint">Appoint and update representative's details</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-lodge" value="afs-lodge">Lodge regulatory transactions</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-mis" value="afs-mis">Register a managed investment scheme</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-pds" value="afs-pds">Lodge a PDS in-use notice</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-learn" value="afs-learn">Learn about ASIC's online services</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-afs" id="content-afs-apply">
                                        <p>Information and steps on how to apply for an Australian financial services (AFS) licence.</p>
                                        <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary asic-button--allow-wrap asic-button--small" href="/for-finance-professionals/afs-licensees/applying-for-and-managing-an-afs-licence/">Applying for and managing an AFS licence</a>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-afs" id="content-afs-update" hidden="">
                                        <p>Update your AFS licence details and lodge financial document via the Regulatory portal.</p><a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="/for-finance-professionals/afs-licensees/changing-details-and-lodging-afs-forms/afs-licensees-changing-your-licence-details-through-the-regulatory-portal/">Changing your licence details through the Regulatory Portal</a>
                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://regulatoryportal.asic.gov.au/Account/SignIn"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://regulatoryportal.asic.gov.au/registration/">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>

                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-afs" id="content-afs-appoint" hidden="">
                                        <p>Log in to ASIC Connect to appoint and update AFS representative's details.</p>
                                        <div>
                                            <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="/online-services/asic-portals/financial-advisers-and-authorised-representatives/">Financial advisers and authorised representatives</a>
